56
00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:22.530
I'm going to shout them out.

57
00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:23.790
Kim, Sarah, and Ellen.

58
00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:27.970
And the four of us would hang out at the skate park with our skateboarding boyfriends,

59
00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:29.490
