Well, that happened, lady.

1631
01:01:36.760 --> 01:01:40.760
Tony Hawk sat across from us for like an hour.

1632
01:01:41.100 --> 01:01:41.360
I know.

1633
01:01:41.660 --> 01:01:42.740
And we talked to him.

1634
01:01:42.860 --> 01:01:43.460
I know.

1635
